/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Word of God is the source of life and health. Thus, the outflow of the Word of health from the heart through the mouth will heal all and every sickness. Furthermore, the word of God is not just for healing; it is for health. Thus, the continual ingestion of the word of God and its expression through your mouth is sufficient for you to live in perpetual health and enjoy the God-kind of life. This book contains scriptures on health, healing and longevity so that you can sow them daily into the soil of your life and body thereby reaping a rich harvest of health, vitality and long-life. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
